full_response:
Here is a script that denies access to a website or service:
```
// Deny access to a website or service
if (request.url.includes("example.com")) {
 response.status = 403;
 response.statusText = "Access denied";
 response.end();
 return;
}
```
This script uses the `if` statement to check if the URL of the incoming request includes the string "example.com". If it does, it sets the HTTP status code to 403 (Forbidden)
